{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/95d0c5753fa4e1475d562943ccd23824.avif?t=1767880810\" width=600 height=128 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run Quad Run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Qubicland needs your reflexes and skills to recover the lost artifacts. Inspired by the difficult skill games of browser games era, Run Quad Run brings you various enemies and a colorful world to discover. Easy to learn, hard to master. With hundreds of unique levels, the game offers features to both starters and hardcore players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/d50fe4115e0404da1adb7cfc6e83d81a.avif?t=1767880810\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of Levels to Finish and Speedrun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Colorful worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Different obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Long Challenging Rooms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race fast to Finish levels within the Target Time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard Run Levels with World Completion Timer for Hardcore Players and Real Runners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/63fe5b4935600f01b114c93c56337255.avif?t=1767880810\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real Runners</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're on the hardcore side and you'd like to <strong>Speedrun</strong> the game, we've got good news!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forced timer, to force you to finish the levels within the target time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total timer &amp; failed run counter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733970/extras/3bec667608a1514984014d0ab046dd1a.avif?t=1767880810\" width=600 height=128 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Never Give Up</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're new to the genre, we've got you covered with a few features that'll help you easily play the game.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reduce enemy speed with speed modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add checkpoints to long rooms to help you run easily.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p.s. We recommend you to play the game on default difficulty. However, it is not mandatory. You can still get the achievements with the reduced difficulty settings. They can be found in the <strong>Gameplay Tab</strong> under <strong>Options</strong> menu.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Grasslands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/2702143329f67be2e50186bf26da865a5461fde6.jpg"},{"name":"Spike Factory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/bcd9a2b7ec89cf407298a8cec7a81a9f3251fdb7.jpg"},{"name":"Junkyard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/20c2deedad739e79f6275455cc4dee59267ad657.jpg"},{"name":"Vast Hills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/a56e1e15254a345ad7e0c779a6e16f402b01e1f7.jpg"},{"name":"Silent Cave","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/a8a5149e494f44b51e102092123a43af4aa0c521.jpg"},{"name":"Wild Town","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3733970/217b0281f2bbc34de5c2c2c849d1c26361cbed0d.jpg"},{"name":"Cemetery","path":"https://cdn.ak